scripts\case-law-information-extraction\output\rules.csv:1095:draftly-rule-courts-coa-ca-423-2000-f-22.1.2019.pdf-1,courts-coa-ca-423-2000-f-22.1.2019.pdf,,COA,2019,A person who claims prescriptive title against the rightful owner who has the paper title has a very heavy burden to prove all the requirements prescribed in section 3 of the Prescription Ordinance.,A person who claims prescriptive title against the rightful owner who has the paper title has a very heavy burden to prove all the requirements prescribed in section 3 of the Prescription Ordinance.,SRC071-s3,none,section 3 of the Prescription Ordinance,True,verbatim,ratio,high,llm-extract,unverified
